{"reviews":[{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-0","r":5.0,"t":"Highly Recommended!","x":"I love this case! It easily fits both 5 and 15 ml bottles, plus I was able to fit in one of my roller bottles. The fabric is thick and strudy, and cute to as well. Zipper has a nice piece of leather as a pull.","h":36,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-1","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect for my purse","x":"I Love it. I think it looks just like the picture. The print is not super vibrant, but I like it. It will fit 10mL roller balls but they are loose since roller balls are tall and skinny. It is meant for 10 mL EO bottles. For that, it's perfect. Very happy with this purchase to keep in my purse. The zipper is well made and has a leather like pull strap.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-2","r":4.0,"t":"Cute","x":"Cute bag... It's slightly smaller than I expected but it works.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-3","r":5.0,"t":"Oil travel case","x":"The bag is adorable and was shipped super fast. I love it, but wish it was just a tiny bit taller. My roll on bottles are fairly snug.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-4","r":5.0,"t":"I love this EO bag","x":"I love this EO bag!!  Love the sturdy fabric and zipper, interior padding and fabric design to keep my bottles safe!!  I can fit 15ml YL bottles in the bag even 15ml with roller tops!  The case has six elastic holders for the bottles and provides a safe, snug fit for my YL bottles.  I am able to fit six 15ml bottles in the case along with a few narrow roller bottles with no problem.  I am ordering more bags so that I can carry the oils in my purse and work bag.  I have gotten so many compliments","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-5","r":5.0,"t":"Best Little Essential Oil Carrying Case Ever!","x":"I've received a lot of compliments about this case. I wanted something smaller to travel with and it's a perfect size; very durable. I took it thru TSA with no problems. The case holds both 5ml & 15ml bottles with no problems. In fact, I place the 15ml Young Living bottles in the holders on both sides and can fit a couple of 5ml bottles in the middle. Love, love this case!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-6","r":5.0,"t":"Pretty and sturdy!","x":"I love this little tincture bottle holder.  It will hold my travel first aid tinctures just right!  It holds 10 ml dropper bottles perfectly.  The quality is very good and sturdy.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-7","r":3.0,"t":"Meh.","x":"I like the bag, BUT, the colors aren\u2019t as vibrant as the photo and the straps that hold the bottles are bigger and lose, so rather than holding just one bottle it\u2019s more for 2+ in each loop- odd. I use this one for roller bottles only, which are even slimmer than the standard oil bottles...and once it\u2019s all filled, it\u2019s a bit hard to zip closed. Idk, it\u2019s ok, but I wouldn\u2019t buy it again.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-8","r":5.0,"t":"Love this! It's a pretty pattern and easily holds ...","x":"Love this!  It's a pretty pattern and easily holds my Oils that I like to carry around. The size will fit well in a purse as well.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-9","r":5.0,"t":"Fits good in my purse","x":"Fits good in my purse! I put 2 roller ball bottles in too with 1 15ml and 3 5ml bottles.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-10","r":4.0,"t":"Cute, but doesn't fit roller bottles very well.","x":"It's cute and fits perfectly in my purse. It holds 5 mL and 15mL bottles really well, but rollers don't fit very well - the case is almost too small for them. They fit fine laying down in the middle, though. I'd prefer this to be just slightly larger so rollers could fit vertically, but it's still very functional and practical.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-11","r":5.0,"t":"Got this in the Paisley color and am happy I did","x":"Got this in the Paisley color and am happy I did! Bag is a great quality and the strap on the zipper feels pretty durable like some sort of leather vs cheap plastic. Very happy with this purchase! Holds my essential oil bottles perfectly!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-12","r":5.0,"t":"Cute floral print...","x":"The floral print is very cute. The case is well made and has a good zipper. It holds enough oils to take on a daily basis and is small enough to fit in my purse. It arrived on time and I would purchase from this company again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-13","r":5.0,"t":"Well made.","x":"Very well made (nice canvas feel, hefty zipper) and cute! I would recommend this to anyone looking for a small case great for portability. I use it to carry essential oils to and from my vehicle for my car diffuser.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-14","r":5.0,"t":"Great for the EO user on the go!","x":"This carrying case is the perfect size to fit in my purse, overnight bag or work bag.  I love being able to take different oils with me to diffuse without having to carry my large carry case.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-15","r":5.0,"t":"This thing is awesome! Fits in my purse","x":"This thing is awesome! Fits in my purse, doesn\u2019t take a lot of room. Fit 6 5 ml bottles and 4 10 ml roller bottles in it! Great Price too. Going to have to order another one for my friend","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-16","r":5.0,"t":"Great travel size.","x":"Love that it is purple and pink, but the size is ideal for traveling, and I like that there is a little bit of padding to help protect the bottles, without being overly bulky.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-17","r":5.0,"t":"Love, love","x":"Love, love, love this! It's the perfect size for my purses to hold the few essential oils I like to keep with me where ever I go. It's also SUPER cute!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-18","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect fit, high quality","x":"I love this little carrying case.  I have all my oils in one spot and it's perfect. They don't clink together and fit snug. It's perfect.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-19","r":5.0,"t":"Pretty pattern and seems well made","x":"Holds some of my essential oils and nothing has leaked into my purse so far. Pretty pattern and seems well made.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-20","r":3.0,"t":"... i have dont stay as secure as i would like but the zipper and the material is very","x":"the 15ml bottles i have dont stay as secure as i would like but the zipper and the material is very nice","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-21","r":5.0,"t":"Good Quality, price an it is also nice and practical","x":"Great product, small, practical, perfect fit for the essential oil bottles. Very good quality","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-22","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect!","x":"Perfect for my young living oils! I can even fit my homemade roller balls in it!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-23","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect size","x":"This is exactly what I was looking for in a purse sized essential oil carrier.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B06XHPHHR4-24","r":5.0,"t":"Love it!","x":"Love. Love, love this! It's so cute and perfect for travel! Very well made!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the case as well made and sturdy, with durable fabric and a good zipper.","cites":[1,5,7,12,13,14]},{"text":"Many reviewers say it fits well in a purse and is a convenient size for carrying oils on the go.","cites":[2,9,10,11,13,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers note it holds 5 ml and 15 ml bottles well, though some find roller bottles fit loosely or snugly.","cites":[2,5,6,8,10,11]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention the colors or print are less vibrant than the photo.","cites":[2,8]},{"text":"Some reviewers wish the case were slightly larger or taller.","cites":[3,4,11]}]},"qa":[]}